:Class JarvisRouter
    ⎕IO←⎕ML←1

    :Field Private Instance ∆controllers

    ∇ new
      :Access Public Instance
      :Implements Constructor
      ∆controllers←⍬
    ∇

    ∇ Register controller
      :Access Public Instance
      ∆controllers,←controller
    ∇

    ∇ {jarvis}←ConfigureJarvis jarvis;commands
      :Access Public Instance
      ⍝ Configure jarvis instance to use controllers for handling REST requests
      commands←∪⊃,/2⌷¨⍉¨∆controllers.OperationHandlers
      jarvis.CodeLocation←⎕THIS
      jarvis.Paradigm←'REST'
      jarvis.RESTMethods←(⍪commands),⊂'RestHandler'
    ∇

    ∇ r←RestHandler req;rc;controller
      :Access Public Instance
      rc r←1 ''
      :For controller :In ∆controllers
          rc r←controller.RestHandler req
          →(rc=0)/0
      :EndFor
      req.Fail 404
     ⍝
    ∇
:EndClass ⍝ JarvisRouter
